    "imageRole": "guided_reading_page",
    "text": "\"In Grade 1,\" said Miss Okafor, \"we will read chapter books, solve number puzzles and begin to understand how the world around us works.\" Aiden thought that sounded like an awful lot — but he found he was leaning forward slightly without meaning to.",
    "answerChoices": [],
